  "description": "VAKPUW crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H82 Gd8 N14 O46,11(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd1A (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2A (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3A (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4A (Gd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 14 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.742-3.958 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.66-119.52°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Gd8C84N14O57H104. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 8 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 8 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
